ga8M(){return"Uninstall Mirinu. To keep the app and start over: in Android's settings, open Apps, then Mirinu, Storage, and clear the storage. Exports you saved elsewhere remain: delete them yourself. A copy kept by your phone's Google backup is managed in that backup's settings."},
